DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261124T183000
SUMMARY:35th Annual Pleasant City Share-A-Supper
LOCATION:500 22nd Street\, West Palm Beach\, FL 33407
CATEGORIES:City events
DESCRIPTION:The City of West Palm Beach is celebrating its 35th Annual Pleasant City Share-A-Supper community event to offer Thanksgiving dinner to residents. City leaders and employees will serve an estimated 400 Thanksgiving dinners to residents and families. The dinner will include turkey\, string beans\, rice\, mashed potatoes\, a dinner roll\, and a beverage. Meals will be provided while supplies last. Tuesday\, November 24\, 2026\, 4:30-6:30 p.m.\, at 500 22nd Street\, West Palm Beach\, FL 33407. Free. For more info\, the Mayor's Insider Newsletter (published 2026-11-20\, retrieved 2026-11-21) says to contact the Pleasant City Community Center at (561) 804-4930 (TTY: 800-955-8771). The Pleasant City Community Center page lists the same event as "Thanksgiving Share-A-Supper\," all ages\, Tuesday\, November 24\, 4:30 p.m.-6:30 p.m.\, free\, at the same address\; that page does not print a year next to November 24\, and its Contact listing is 561-822-4930. The year 2026 is taken from the newsletter page (title: "Mayor's Insider Newsletter for Friday\, Nov. 20\, 2026")\; November 24\, 2026 is a Tuesday. Source: City email "News & Events in the City of West Palm Beach" (Nov 20\, 2026)\; Mayor's Insider Newsletter: https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/112026-Mayors-Insider-Newsletter\; Pleasant City Community Center page (retrieved 2026-11-21): https://www.wpb.org/Departments/Parks-Recreation/Parks-Facilities/Pleasant-City-Community-Center-and-Youth-Empowerment-Center
URL:https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/112026-Mayors-Insider-Newsletter
END:VEVENT
