DESCRIPTION:For families with kids of all ages. In this sing-along storytelling experience\, children learn about opera and meet some of opera's most beloved characters. Join Palm Beach Opera for a reading of Hansel and Gretel. Experience an operatic retelling of the classic fairy tale\, featuring the whimsical characters of the Sandman and the Dew Fairy. Palm Beach Opera's Story Time Series is part of the Douglas and Delphine Daft Education & Engagement Programs\, with additional support from the Palm Beach Opera Guild. Space is limited\, and in-person sign-up begins in KidSpace at 4 p.m. Source: Mandel Public Library newsletter "It's National Native American Heritage Month" (Nov 12\, 2026)\; event page (retrieved 2026-11-13): https://mandel-fl.whofi.com/calendar/event/353753
