DESCRIPTION:Join us to learn about habitat needs. Then\, pose in our festive photo booth & decorate your own photo frame - a great homemade gift! Sunday\, December 20\, 2026\, 10:00 a.m.–11:30 a.m. Ages: All ages (with participating adult). Cost: Free\, but space is limited. Reservations required. Check in at the Nature Center 15 min prior to program start time. Come prepared: Wear comfortable walking shoes\, sunscreen\, and bring refillable water bottle. Reservations required. Please call the Nature Center to reserve a spot: 561-804-4985. Source: City email "Grassy Waters Film Screening & December Programs" (received Nov 19\, 2026)\; Public Program Calendar (retrieved 2026-11-20): https://www.wpb.org/Departments/Grassy-Waters-Preserve/Public-Program-Calendar\; program page (retrieved 2026-11-20): https://www.wpb.org/Departments/Grassy-Waters-Preserve/Public-Program-Calendar/Homemade-Holidays-Series-Picture-Perfect-Habitats-122026
