DTSTAMP:20261114T142600Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261117
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261118
SUMMARY:Bulk and yard waste collection resumes (Briar Bay / Hamilton Bay)
LOCATION:Briar Bay\, Hamilton Bay\, and surrounding communities\, West Palm Beach\, FL
CATEGORIES:City services
DESCRIPTION:The City's Nov 12\, 2026 flood-response news release says bulk and yard waste collection will resume Tuesday\, November 17. Residents will not be charged for excess bulk or yard waste accumulated during the flooding-related service interruption. The Mayor's Insider Newsletter (published 2026-11-13) specifies that collection will resume Tuesday\, November 17 in these communities\, referring to Briar Bay\, Hamilton Bay\, and neighboring areas. Regular residential garbage and recycling already resumed November 11\, with another round of collections November 12. Source: City email "News & Events in the City of West Palm Beach" (Nov 13\, 2026)\; Mayor's Insider Newsletter (published 2026-11-13\, retrieved 2026-11-14): https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/111226-Mayrs-Insider-Newsletter\; City news release "West Palm Beach Provides Update on Ongoing Flood Response Efforts" (published 2026-11-12\, retrieved 2026-11-14): https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/111226-Flooding-Update
URL:https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/111226-Flooding-Update
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wpb-svc-business-survey-deadline-2026-11-20@awormus.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261114T142600Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T170000
SUMMARY:West Palm Beach Business Survey deadline (TIP Strategies)
CATEGORIES:City services
DESCRIPTION:The City of West Palm Beach invites the City's business establishments to participate in a brief survey to help inform policies intended to guide the City's economic growth and resilience. The survey is being conducted on behalf of the City by TIP Strategies\, an Austin-based economic strategy firm. The newsletter states the survey is completely confidential\; no identifying information will be published\, and results will be provided in aggregate only. All survey responses must be completed by Friday\, November 20\, 2026\, at 5 p.m. This calendar entry marks that deadline\; it is not a public meeting. Take the survey: https://survey.zohopublic.com/zs/NhC5wV (title on the public survey page\, retrieved 2026-11-14: "West Palm Beach Business Survey"). Source: City email "News & Events in the City of West Palm Beach" (Nov 13\, 2026)\; Mayor's Insider Newsletter (published 2026-11-13\, retrieved 2026-11-14): https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/111226-Mayrs-Insider-Newsletter
URL:https://survey.zohopublic.com/zs/NhC5wV
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
