DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270415
SUMMARY:Tomorrow.City USA (Smart City Expo World Congress)
LOCATION:West Palm Beach\, FL
CATEGORIES:City events
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow.City USA is the American flagship of Smart City Expo World Congress by Fira Barcelona. The event website title and body list April 13-14\, 2027\, in West Palm Beach. The Mayor's Insider Newsletter states the City will host the expo for the second consecutive year on those dates. The official visit page (retrieved 2026-11-14) describes a downtown conference and refers to "the venue" and "the convention center" but does not give a formal venue name or street address. Event site: https://tomorrowcity.us/ Source: City email "News & Events in the City of West Palm Beach" (Nov 13\, 2026)\; Mayor's Insider Newsletter (published 2026-11-13\, retrieved 2026-11-14): https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/111226-Mayrs-Insider-Newsletter\; event website (retrieved 2026-11-14): https://tomorrowcity.us/
URL:https://tomorrowcity.us/
