BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wpb-pr-winter-junior-soccer-2027@awormus.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261114T142600Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270109
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270221
SUMMARY:Youth Winter / Spring Soccer League (Winter Junior Soccer 2027)
LOCATION:Howard Park Community Center\, 1302 Parker Avenue\, West Palm Beach\, FL 33401
CATEGORIES:Parks,Kids
DESCRIPTION:Registration for 2027 Winter Junior Soccer is open\, as stated in the Mayor's Insider Newsletter. On parks.wpb.org the program is listed as Youth Winter / Spring Soccer League (activity 211103). No registration deadline was listed on the parks activity pages retrieved 2026-11-14. Confirmed winter-session dates for Coed Soccer Ages 4 through 6 (211103-H1): January 9 through February 20\, 2027\, Saturdays 9:00-10:00 a.m.\, at Howard Park Community Center\, 1302 Parker Ave\, West Palm Beach\, FL 33401. Fees listed: $60 resident / $75 non-resident. The activity page asks participants to bring water\, a size 3 ball\, and cleats\, and notes volunteer coaches are needed. The same league also lists spring sections for ages 7-8\, 9-10 (Tue/Thu 6:00-7:00 p.m.) and ages 11-14 (Tue/Thu 7:00-8:30 p.m.) from March 9 through May 13\, 2027\, also at Howard Park Community Center. The newsletter also says you can register in person at any City of West Palm Beach Community Center or by calling (561) 804-4900 (TTY: 800-955-8771). Register online: https://parks.wpb.org/wbwsc/webtrac.wsc/search.html?module=AR&type=10 Source: City email "News & Events in the City of West Palm Beach" (Nov 13\, 2026)\; Mayor's Insider Newsletter (published 2026-11-13\, retrieved 2026-11-14): https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/111226-Mayrs-Insider-Newsletter\; parks activity listing (retrieved 2026-11-14): https://parks.wpb.org/wbwsc/webtrac.wsc/search.html?module=AR&type=10
URL:https://parks.wpb.org/wbwsc/webtrac.wsc/search.html?module=AR&type=10
END:VEVENT

