BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wpb-svc-thanksgiving-closures-2026-11-26@awormus.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261121T143500Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261127
SUMMARY:Thanksgiving holiday closures (City Hall, Mandel Public Library, Grassy Waters, non-essential services)
LOCATION:City Hall\, Mandel Public Library\, and Grassy Waters Preserve Nature Center\, West Palm Beach\, FL
CATEGORIES:City services
DESCRIPTION:West Palm Beach City Hall\, the Mandel Public Library\, the Grassy Waters Preserve Nature Center\, and all non-essential services will be closed on Thursday\, November 26\, and Friday\, November 27\, 2026\, in observance of the Thanksgiving holiday. This all-day closure entry is for Thursday\, November 26\, 2026. Grassy Waters will reopen at 8 a.m.\, on Saturday\, November 28\, 2026\; the Mandel Public Library will open at 9:30 a.m. that Saturday. City Hall will reopen at 8 a.m. on Monday\, November 30\, 2026. The City's "Celebrating Thanksgiving 2026" event page lists a When range of Thursday\, November 26\, 2026\, 8:00 a.m. through Saturday\, November 28\, 2026\, 8:00 a.m.\, which ends at the stated Grassy Waters reopen time. The same page's notice and the official news release describe Thursday and Friday as closure days\, so this calendar uses all-day date entries for November 26 and 27 rather than a timed 8:00 a.m. start. This entry also covers the Grassy Waters Thanksgiving closure notice on that event page (the listing previously skipped when only December Grassy Waters programs were ingested). Source: City email "Update: 112026 - Thanksgiving" (Nov 20\, 2026)\; official release "City Offices to Close in Observance of the Thanksgiving Holidays" (published 2026-11-20\, retrieved 2026-11-21): https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/112026-Thanksgiving\; event page "Celebrating Thanksgiving 2026" (retrieved 2026-11-21): https://www.wpb.org/Events-Folder/2026/112626-Thanksgiving-Holiday
URL:https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/112026-Thanksgiving
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wpb-svc-thanksgiving-trash-2026-11-26@awormus.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261121T143500Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261127
SUMMARY:Thanksgiving Holiday Trash Collection Schedule (Thanksgiving Day)
CATEGORIES:City services
DESCRIPTION:Thanksgiving Holiday Trash Collection Schedule for Thursday\, November 26\, 2026 (Thanksgiving Day): Residential: No service. Collection will resume on your next scheduled service day. Recycling: No service. Collection will resume on your next scheduled service day. Bulk/Yard Waste: Service will be delayed by one day. Commercial: Service will be delayed by one day. The City's Holiday Trash Pick Up Schedule page lists the same rules for Thanksgiving (4th Thursday of November) and the Day after Thanksgiving (4th Friday of November). Notes on that page: "No service = Service will resume on your next scheduled service day"\; "One day delay = Service will be delayed by one day for the remainder of the week." A banner on related City pages says "No trash collection Thurs. Resumes Fri.\," which matches Friday residential and recycling being back on schedule but does not mention the bulk/yard and commercial one-day delays listed on the detailed schedule. This entry follows the official news release and the Holiday Trash Pick Up Schedule table. Source: City email "Update: 112026 - Thanksgiving" (Nov 20\, 2026)\; official release "City Offices to Close in Observance of the Thanksgiving Holidays" (published 2026-11-20\, retrieved 2026-11-21): https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/112026-Thanksgiving\; Holiday Trash Pick Up Schedule (retrieved 2026-11-21): https://www.wpb.org/Departments/Public-Works/Solid-Waste/Holiday-Trash-Pick-Up-Schedule\; also linked from the event page "Celebrating Thanksgiving 2026": https://www.wpb.org/Events-Folder/2026/112626-Thanksgiving-Holiday
URL:https://www.wpb.org/Departments/Public-Works/Solid-Waste/Holiday-Trash-Pick-Up-Schedule
END:VEVENT
