SUMMARY:Road closures: U.S. Polo Assn. Palm Beaches Marathon
LOCATION:Flagler Drive and surrounding streets\, West Palm Beach\, FL
CATEGORIES:City services
DESCRIPTION:Event road closures for the U.S. Polo Assn. Palm Beaches Marathon. The notice heading is "Saturday\, December 12 through Monday\, December 15." Dated windows as printed: From Friday\, December 11\, 2026\, at 10 a.m. to Sunday\, December 14\, 2026\, at 7 a.m.: Flagler Drive between Banyan Boulevard and Lakeview Avenue. On Saturday\, December 12\, 2026\, from 6 a.m. with rolling openings starting at 9:15 a.m.: South Flagler Drive between Lakeview Boulevard and Southern Boulevard; Washington Road between Avila Road and Southern Boulevard. On Sunday\, December 13\, 2026\, from 5 a.m. with rolling openings beginning at noon: North/South Flagler Drive from 59th Street to Southern Boulevard; Washington Road between Avila Road and Southern Boulevard; Greenwood Road and Roosevelt Place\, between Flagler Drive and Vincent Road inclusive. No separate times are given for Monday\, December 15. Source: City email 'Update: 111926 - Road and Dock' (Nov 19\, 2026); City news release 'Road and Dock for Thursday\, Nov.19\, 2026' (published 2026-11-18\, retrieved 2026-11-19): https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/111926-Road-and-Dock
